{\large\textbf{\color{hdrblue}WeKnow Technologies}}
\textit{(Full Stack Developer)} \hfill May 2025 -- Present

\begin{itemize}

\item Developing and maintaining secure and scalable government web applications using \textbf{PHP, MySQL, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript}.

\item Designing and implementing \textbf{RESTful APIs} to enable seamless communication between frontend interfaces and backend services.

\item Writing optimized \textbf{SQL queries and stored procedures} to efficiently handle large datasets and improve database performance.

\item Implementing backend business logic for government service platforms to support real-time digital workflows.

\item Debugging and resolving application issues to improve overall system stability and reliability.

\item Collaborating with cross-functional teams including developers, testers, and project managers, to deliver high-quality web solutions.

\item Enhancing application performance by optimizing backend processes and reducing response times.

\item Implementing validation, authentication mechanisms, and secure coding practices to ensure data integrity and system security.

\item Assisting in deployment and maintenance of web applications on production servers using \textbf{Apache and Linux environments}.

\item Participating in feature enhancements and system upgrades to improve functionality and user experience of government platforms.


\end{itemize}

