{\large\textbf{\color{hdrblue}Outlier}}
\textit{(Data Annotator \& AI Model Evaluator)} \hfill Mar 2024 -- Jun 2025

\begin{itemize}

\item Worked on \textbf{prompt engineering} to evaluate and improve responses generated by large language models.

\item Analyzed AI-generated response for logical consistency, reasoning quality, and factual correctness.

\item Evaluated complex prompts across \textbf{STEM domains including mathematics, science, and logical reasoning}.

\item Identified model weaknesses and provided structured feedback to improve AI response quality.

\item Assisted in the creation and refinement of training datasets used for improving multimodal AI systems.

\end{itemize}

\vspace{3pt}

{\large\textbf{\color{hdrblue}Oasis Infobyte}}
\textit{(Web Development Intern)} \hfill Jun 2024 -- Jul 2024

\begin{itemize}

\item Developed a \textbf{GitHub Explorer web application} to fetch and display GitHub user profiles using the GitHub API.

\item Implemented asynchronous JavaScript using the \textbf{Fetch API} for dynamic data retrieval.

\item Designed a \textbf{responsive UI} for seamless usage across devices.

\item Implemented \textbf{input validation and error handling} for improved user experience.

\end{itemize}

\vspace{3pt}

{\large\textbf{\color{hdrblue}Drycode Pvt. Limited}}
\textit{(Web Developer Intern)} \hfill May 2024 -- Jun 2024

\begin{itemize}

\item Developed frontend features for web applications using \textbf{HTML, CSS, and JavaScript}.

\item Implemented \textbf{DOM manipulation and event handling} to build dynamic UI components.

\end{itemize}

