\section*{EDUCATION}

\textbf{School of Management Sciences, Lucknow} \hfill Sep 2022 -- Jul 2025

Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA)

\newpage

% PROJECTS

\section*{PROJECTS}

\textbf{UPSFMS – Uttar Pradesh State Fertilizer Management System} \\
Developed a comprehensive internal software system for managing fertilizer distribution and monitoring across Uttar Pradesh. The system includes role-based user access, separate dashboards for different users, API-based data fetching from servers, activity logs, and data tracking features. The application is designed to simplify operations related to fertilizer stock, distribution, and reporting at the state level. The system includes dashboard analytics, report generation, stock monitoring, user activity logs, and role-based access for different departments across the state. \\
\href{http://upsfms.com}{http://upsfms.com}

\vspace{5pt}

\textbf{E-TOKEN Mobile Applications – Farmers and Retailers (React Native)} \\
Developed mobile applications for farmers and retailers for token-based service and queue management system in collaboration with WeKnow Technologies. The applications include OTP-based login authentication, token generation, dashboard views, and server-based data synchronization through APIs. The applications are fully functional and currently in testing phase before production deployment.

\vspace{5pt}

\textbf{ERP Systems – Colleges, Schools and Hotels} \\
Worked on multiple ERP systems for educational institutions including KNIPSS Sultanpur, Raghuveer Mahavidyalaya Jaunpur, and MEA School Rudauli Ayodhya. The ERP systems included modules such as student management, admission management, fee management, receipt generation, reports, dashboard analytics, and OTP-based login authentication for secure user access. 

Also worked on hotel ERP systems which included table booking, order booking, room booking, billing system, customer management, and administrative dashboards for hotel operations. 

Involved in backend development, database design, SQL query optimization, report generation, role-based user access control, activity logs, and dashboard systems for management and administrative users.

\vspace{5pt}

\textbf{Spice Serve – Catering Services Booking Website (Major Project)} \\
Designed and developed a multi-page catering service booking website where users can browse dishes, select catering services, and make booking requests. The backend database was hosted on Neon DB and the website included multiple pages, booking forms, database connectivity, and responsive design. Developed as the major project during the Bachelor of Computer Applications. \\
\href{https://spice-serve.onrender.com/}{https://spice-serve.onrender.com/}

\vspace{5pt}

\textbf{GitHub Explorer – Minor Project} \\
Developed a web application using GitHub API to fetch and display GitHub user profile information dynamically. Implemented asynchronous JavaScript using Fetch API, error handling, input validation, and responsive UI design. \\
\href{https://github.com/Silent237/GitHub-explorer}{https://github.com/Silent237/GitHub-explorer}

\vspace{5pt}

\textbf{Oasis Infobyte Internship Projects} \\
Developed multiple frontend projects including To-Do List Web Application, Calculator, and Tribute Page using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript during internship period. All projects were mobile responsive and focused on DOM manipulation, event handling, and UI design. \\
\href{https://github.com/Silent237/OIBSIP}{https://github.com/Silent237/OIBSIP}

\vspace{5pt}

\textbf{Dynamic Websites and Web Applications} \\
Designed and developed multiple dynamic websites and web applications with database connectivity, admin panels, dashboards, and responsive layouts for educational institutions, businesses, and service platforms. Key websites developed are listed below:

\begin{itemize}
\item Tipsy Town – \href{https://tipsytown.in/}{tipsytown.in}
\item Shane Avadh – \href{https://shaneavadh.in/}{shaneavadh.in}
\item Bedis Dreamland – \href{https://www.bedisdreamland.com/}{bedisdreamland.com}
\item GBP College – \href{https://gbpcollege.ac.in}{gbpcollege.ac.in}
\item AND KPG College – \href{https://andkpgcollege.com}{andkpgcollege.com}
\end{itemize}

